{
  "name": "Recheck HubSpot contact emails every month and flag the ones that stopped working",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Recheck HubSpot contact emails every month and flag the ones that stopped working\n\n### How it works\nCatch dead addresses before your sends do. On the first of each month the workflow reads up to max_checks HubSpot contacts with their email and checks each address with Argorant. The result (valid, invalid, catch_all, risky or unknown) and the check date are written to two contact properties. Build an active list in HubSpot on argorant_email_status is invalid to keep those contacts out of sends and to find the people who changed jobs.\n\nCosts: half a credit per fresh check, capped by max_checks.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. In HubSpot, create the contact properties argorant_email_status and argorant_checked_on (single line text).\n4. Add a HubSpot App Token credential (contacts read and write) to both HubSpot nodes.\n5. Set max_checks in **Settings** and activate.\n\n### Customization\nRecheck only contacts not checked in the last 90 days with a HubSpot filter.",
        "height": 653,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "fb685aad-e111-414f-8621-3c237fafa523",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pick contacts\nContacts with an email, at most max_checks a month.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "463003aa-ea10-4b69-a448-1bc9dc6a46c6",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Check and flag\nHalf a credit per fresh check. The result lands on the contact.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "afb271e1-d507-447a-9547-69fda814ec8f",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "months",
              "triggerAtDayOfMonth": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8477ddd7-18d4-485c-ba0e-4a901ddbfbfa",
      "name": "First of the month",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c9cb19fa-0f07-4b10-8283-c22faac50e67",
              "name": "max_checks",
              "value": "500",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "21c53747-7f9d-4f75-b758-42acbf6a067c",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": "={{ $json.max_checks }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "propertiesCollection": {
            "propertiesValues": {
              "properties": [
                "email"
              ],
              "propertyMode": "valueOnly"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "05b1c628-ef0d-41b1-966f-d67b8d8b58fc",
      "name": "Get contacts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a32ac1db-f12b-41e8-ad0f-3643ad96739a",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.properties?.email?.value }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "07918aa5-974c-4750-afb7-ea560c39e6d5",
      "name": "Has an email?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "maxItems": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.max_checks }}"
      },
      "id": "c12abc6c-b7ca-43e2-80bf-c39b4794e3c1",
      "name": "Cap per month",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.limit",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "email",
        "operation": "check",
        "email": "={{ $json.properties.email.value }}"
      },
      "id": "b1c4979c-0bef-425e-a5db-e2828f440cc6",
      "name": "Check the address",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-argorant.argorant",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "email": "={{ $('Cap per month').item.json.properties.email.value }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "customPropertiesUi": {
            "customPropertiesValues": [
              {
                "property": "argorant_email_status",
                "value": "={{ $json.status || 'not checked' }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "argorant_checked_on",
                "value": "={{ $now.toISODate() }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "813f6802-d08b-4987-a36e-9cddb1e85879",
      "name": "Write the result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
